      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "For Family Sharing transactions, the revocation reason value is `0` if the customer leaves the family group or the owner stops sharing. If the purchaser of a Family Sharing transaction receives a refund, the revocation reason for Family Sharing transactions matches the value of the purchaser’s revocation reason.",
